        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"e0d650d0-5a45-43c0-918d-949b581e847b\",\"review_text\":\"I love this app and use for many years\"},{\"review_id\":\"8f8ed5bf-bfd7-453b-a520-e3839653e7a6\",\"review_text\":\"Exceptional\"},{\"review_id\":\"32698d9e-4609-4415-9c2c-da0259fb9433\",\"review_text\":\"It's a great app but doesn't allow you to connect to your galaxy watch anymore. Please can this issue be rectified and updated. Its really frustrating\"},{\"review_id\":\"3f98d648-a0b5-487b-a2b7-7dc7fd7da992\",\"review_text\":\"Hate this app👎\"},{\"review_id\":\"40becd30-9988-4e95-96db-96c168ba5938\",\"review_text\":\"Recommend to anyone that looks for consistency\"},{\"review_id\":\"fab1f82f-e63e-49fb-8093-b8d6b79b0c2e\",\"review_text\":\"Love My Spotify!Since it all began for me I've not had trouble in any regard, app runs smoothly and just loving my own chosen music,sharing my subscription as a family plan,so even my household doesn't lose out\"},{\"review_id\":\"264c6542-5c66-430c-9b37-450197d36107\",\"review_text\":\"This app was working great until now I have not able to use it in four days stop monkeying around it comes up then shuts off if I could move my music downloads to another music app I would have done it by now I'm tired of it being on and back off again I have tried to to put Spotify premium on my phone but my android phone does not accept the pin number I'm not going to waist money on a card that doesn't work it also kept. Telling me that I had no internet connection when I was using it offline\"},{\"review_id\":\"0ccd6dfb-2fe4-41c7-b606-6d0beb6814a6\",\"review_text\":\"amazing app thanks\"},{\"review_id\":\"c1e7756f-8e08-4298-bd6b-300082f9ab98\",\"review_text\":\"App is completely build with bugs ... seeking bar is not working. And the couldn't shuffle songs without premium account\"},{\"review_id\":\"3560701e-0ec3-49ea-ae82-3331e9203ac2\",\"review_text\":\"Yup\"}]}"
